flowchart LR
  A[Ingress DB] --> B[Custom Kafka Connect Source <br/> change events]
  B --> C[contentReference - oaicite0 - index=0 <br/> raw.cdc.* topics]

  C --> D[Validate + Normalize <br/> optional Streams/ksqlDB]
  D -->|bad| X[DLQ topic + error table]
  D -->|good| E[stg.* topics - conformed]

  E --> F[Sink to Intermediate Postgres <br/> staging tables]
  F --> G[SQL transforms / dbt / stored procs <br/> 3–10 min schedule]
  G --> H[Final Postgres <br/> target tables]

  C -. replay/backfill .-> D
  F -. audit/reconcile .-> G